html). Buffett's Berkshire Hathaway Inc. (BRKA) [s:brkb] revealed in a regulatory filing earlier this month that it had bought 12.4 million shares (http://www.marketwatch.com/story/buffetts-berkshire-hathaway-buys-another-124-million-apple-shares-2018-08-14) of Apple in the second quarter to a total of nearly 252 million shares as of June 30. Apple shares were up 0.4%.\n-William L. Watts; 1143ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/buffetts-berkshire-hathaway-buys-another-124-million-apple-shares-2018-08-14)", "https://www.cnbc.com/2018/08/30/warren-buffett-2.html)."], "published": "2018-08-30T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-08-30T18:49:59.245+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}